id=miuicamera_tanzanite
name=MiuiCamera Universal (AOSP / HyperOS)
version=2.0
versionCode=20
author=gbrsaski20
description=Satu modul MiuiCamera (com.android.camera) untuk semua ROM AOSP/LineageOS/EvoX/HyperOS di tanzanite. Framework compat (CameraCharacteristics.getNativeCopy) sudah di-patch langsung di APK, privapp whitelist lengkap, privapp enforcement dilonggarkan, deteksi overlay & konflik paket otomatis, laporan diagnosa di /sdcard/micam_status.txt.
